{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0346C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Chico把那架直升机叫作“Colibrí”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"这边管蜂鸟叫这个。那架直升机的动作也很像吧，比如能悬停在空中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过个头可差远了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是啊。不过总比“Hombre Nuevo”这个名字好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"要是被Colibrí<R=抓走,raptar>就完了。会被带到战俘营，拷问到把同伴的事全招出来为止。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=抓走,raptar>","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;RUBY_LOCALIZED_SPANISH_READING"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Chico就是被那家伙<R=抓走,abduct>的吗……","cn_control_tokens":"<R=抓走,abduct>","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;RUBY_LOCALIZED_ENGLISH_READING"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"他们的拷问毫不留情。就算招了，也会像破布一样被扔掉……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"明知道会这样，我还是没能救Chico。既然救不了，不如亲手……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"别这么轻易说这种话。就算失去名誉，有时也必须活下去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"放心。Chico我一定会救出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":38,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX;JPN_PRIMARY"}]}